<title>UK: BOE allots 420 mln stg in repos to June 2.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 420 mln stg in repos to June 2.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 420 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 420 million stg in repos to June 2.</p>
<p>The shortage is forecast at 1.4 billin stg.</p>
</text>
